{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"lair_void_rift_destroyed","model_identifier":"lair_void_rift_destroyed","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# lair_void_rift_destroyed\n\nlair_void_rift_destroyed: the cleared / destroyed state of lair_void_rift.\n\nShown once players clear the lair; no spawning. Same footprint and origin as the intact model.\n\n- Cubes: 9 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -90.0..90.0, y 0.0..2.5, z -70.0..70.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- flat ground and debris only (no hit box needed; walkable)\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n\n## Notes\n\n- The rift has closed: no tear; the frost has melted into puddles on dark, cracked soil, a burnt scar where it hung, a few dead violet shards on the ground.\n"},"description":"# lair_void_rift_destroyed\n\nlair_void_rift_destroyed: the cleared / destroyed state of lair_void_rift.\n\nShown once players clear the lair; no spawning. Same footprint and origin as the intact model.\n\n- Cubes: 9 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -90.0..90.0, y 0.0..2.5, z -70.0..70.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- flat ground and debris only (no hit box needed; walkable)\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n\n## Notes\n\n- The rift has closed: no tear; the frost has melted into puddles on dark, cracked soil, a burnt scar where it hung, a few dead violet shards on the ground.\n","resolution":{"width":256,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"ground_plate","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"defau